      </div>
      <div class="lp-agent lp-ag"><div class="lp-ag-top"><div class="lp-h"><h3>Or hand it to your coding agent</h3></div><div class="lp-h lp-ag-top-r"><p>Every page has a Markdown copy, and <a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a> lists every component with its install command. Give your agent this prompt, and it finds, reads and installs what your screen needs.</p><a class="lp-more" href="/docs/using-with-ai">Using with AI<Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a></div></div><ol class="lp-ag-flow" aria-label="From a prompt to an installed component"><li class="lp-ag-step" style="--k:0"><p class="lp-ag-sh"><span class="lp-ag-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>You ask</p><div class="lp-ag-win" role="group" aria-label="The prompt"><div class="lp-ag-wb"><span>Your coding agent</span><button class="lp-copy" type="button" data-copy={PROMPT} data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy the prompt">Copy</button></div><div class="lp-ag-wbody lp-ag-chat"><p class="lp-ag-bub">Read <code>{SITE}/llms.txt</code> and pick the components for our screen. For each one, read its .md page, then install it with:<span class="lp-ag-cmd"><code>npx designme add &lt;name&gt; --react</code></span>Keep the installed files as they are and drive the components through their props from our state.</p></div></div></li><li class="lp-ag-step" style="--k:1"><p class="lp-ag-sh"><span class="lp-ag-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>It reads</p><div class="lp-ag-win" role="group" aria-label="What the agent reads"><a class="lp-ag-fh" href="/llms.txt"><Fragment set:html={fileIcon} /><span class="lp-ag-fn">llms.txt</span><span class="lp-ag-dm">{total} components</span></a><span class="lp-ag-pre" aria-hidden="true"><span class="l">### Agent status</span><span class="l cm">- [Thinking](…/thinking.md)</span><span class="l cm">- [Reasoning trail](…/reasoning-trail.md)</span><span class="l cm">  …</span><span class="l lp-ag-pick">- [Status pill](…/status-pill.md)</span><span class="l lp-ag-pick st">  npx designme add status-pill</span></span><a class="lp-ag-fh lp-ag-fh2" href="/components/status-pill.md"><Fragment set:html={fileIcon} /><span class="lp-ag-fn">status-pill.md</span><span class="lp-ag-dm">Props</span></a><span class="lp-ag-pre lp-ag-props" aria-hidden="true"><span class="l"><span class="lp-ag-c">| </span>state<span class="lp-ag-c">    | </span><span class="lp-ag-t">StatusPillState</span></span><span class="l"><span class="lp-ag-c">| </span>label<span class="lp-ag-c">    | </span><span class="lp-ag-t">string</span></span><span class="l"><span class="lp-ag-c">| </span>action<span class="lp-ag-c">   | </span><span class="lp-ag-t">{'{ label, onClick }'}</span></span><span class="l"><span class="lp-ag-c">| </span>progress<span class="lp-ag-c"> | </span><span class="lp-ag-t">number</span></span></span></div></li><li class="lp-ag-step" style="--k:2"><p class="lp-ag-sh"><span class="lp-ag-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>It installs</p><div class="lp-ag-win" role="group" aria-label="What it installs"><div class="lp-ag-wb"><span>Terminal</span></div><div class="lp-ag-wbody"><p class="lp-ag-run"><code><span class="lp-ag-c">$ </span>npx designme add status-pill --react</code></p><ul class="lp-ag-files"><li style="--j:0"><svg class="lp-ag-tk" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>status-pill/StatusPill.tsx</span></li><li style="--j:1"><svg class="lp-ag-tk" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>status-pill/status-pill.css</span></li><li style="--j:2"><svg class="lp-ag-tk" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>designme.css</span><span class="lp-ag-dm">added once</span></li><li style="--j:3"><svg class="lp-ag-tk" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>lib/</span><span class="lp-ag-dm">added once</span></li></ul><p class="lp-ag-use"><span>Then, from your state</span><code>&lt;StatusPill state="working" label="Editing" /&gt;</code></p></div></div></li></ol></div>
